                "file_text": "# Username & Password Reset Implementation\n\n## Overview\nThis document outlines the implementation of username support and password reset functionality with anonymous user handling.\n\n## Features Implemented\n\n### 1. Username Support\n- **Signup**: Users provide username during registration\n- **Storage**: Username stored in Supabase `auth.users.raw_user_meta_data`\n- **Profile Table**: Automatic profile creation via database trigger\n- **Display**: Username shown in Settings screen\n\n### 2. Password Reset Flow\n- **Forgot Password Screen**: Email input to request reset link\n- **Email Delivery**: Supabase sends password reset email\n- **Deep Linking**: App handles `streamwatch://reset-password` links\n- **Reset Password Screen**: User enters new password\n- **Validation**: Password must be 6+ characters and match confirmation\n\n### 3. Anonymous User Support\n- **Guest Profiles**: Auto-generated with `guest_12345678` username\n- **Guest Banner**: Dismissible banner prompting signup\n- **Data Warning**: Alert before sign out for guest users\n- **Profile Flag**: `is_guest` column tracks guest status\n\n## Database Schema\n\n### profiles Table\n```sql\nCREATE TABLE profiles (\n  id UUID REFERENCES auth.users(id) ON DELETE CASCADE PRIMARY KEY,\n  username TEXT UNIQUE NOT NULL,\n  is_guest BOOLEAN DEFAULT false,\n  created_at TIMESTAMP WITH TIME ZONE DEFAULT NOW(),\n  updated_at TIMESTAMP WITH TIME ZONE DEFAULT NOW()\n);\n```\n\n### Trigger\n- `on_auth_user_created`: Automatically creates profile on user signup\n- Detects anonymous users via `is_anonymous` flag\n- Generates appropriate username based on user type\n\n## New Files Created\n\n### Screens\n- `src/screens/ForgotPasswordScreen.tsx` - Password reset request\n- `src/screens/ResetPasswordScreen.tsx` - New password entry\n\n### Components\n- `src/components/GuestBanner.tsx` - Guest user notification banner\n\n### Hooks\n- `src/hooks/useProfile.ts` - Profile data fetching hook\n\n### Types\n- Added `UserProfile` interface to `src/types/index.ts`\n\n## Modified Files\n\n### App.tsx\n- Added deep linking configuration\n- Added navigation for auth screens\n- Handles password reset deep links\n\n### AuthScreen.tsx\n- Added username field to signup form\n- Added \"Forgot Password?\" link to login form\n- Username validation (min 3 characters)\n\n### HomeScreen.tsx\n- Added GuestBanner component\n- Banner dismissal with AsyncStorage\n- Navigation to signup from banner\n\n### SettingsScreen.tsx\n- Display user profile with username\n- Show guest badge for anonymous users\n- Warning dialog before guest sign out\n\n### app.json\n- Added `scheme: \"streamwatch\"` for deep linking\n- Added iOS associated domains\n- Added Android intent filters\n\n## Deep Linking Setup\n\n### URL Schemes\n- `streamwatch://reset-password` - Password reset\n- `streamwatch://auth/callback` - Auth callback\n- `https://lnuxpkwnbesqrqsxyiek.supabase.co/auth/*` - Supabase auth\n\n### Configuration\n```json\n{\n  \"scheme\": \"streamwatch\",\n  \"ios\": {\n    \"associatedDomains\": [\"applinks:lnuxpkwnbesqrqsxyiek.supabase.co\"]\n  },\n  \"android\": {\n    \"intentFilters\": [...]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## User Flows\n\n### New User Signup\n1. User clicks \"Create Account\"\n2. Enters username, email, password\n3. Supabase creates auth user with metadata\n4. Database trigger creates profile\n5. User receives confirmation email\n\n### Password Reset\n1. User clicks \"Forgot Password?\" on login\n2. Enters email address\n3. Supabase sends reset email\n4. User clicks link in email\n5. App opens to ResetPasswordScreen\n6. User enters new password\n7. Password updated via Supabase\n\n### Guest User Journey\n1. User clicks \"Continue as Guest\"\n2. Anonymous auth creates temporary user\n3. Profile created with `guest_` prefix\n4. Banner shown prompting signup\n5. User can add favorites (data persists in session)\n6. On sign out, warned about data loss\n\n## Testing Checklist\n\n- [ ] Signup with username creates profile\n- [ ] Username appears in Settings\n- [ ] Forgot password sends email\n- [ ] Password reset link opens app\n- [ ] New password can be set\n- [ ] Guest login creates guest profile\n- [ ] Guest banner appears for anonymous users\n- [ ] Guest banner can be dismissed\n- [ ] Sign out warning shows for guests\n- [ ] Deep links work on iOS/Android\n\n## Future Enhancements\n\n### Account Conversion\n- Allow guests to convert to permanent accounts\n- Preserve favorites during conversion\n- Update username from `guest_` to chosen name\n\n### Profile Features\n- Avatar upload\n- Bio/description\n- Display name vs username\n- Profile visibility settings\n\n### Cleanup\n- Scheduled job to delete old guest accounts\n- Remove guests with no favorites after 30 days\n\n## Notes\n\n- Username stored in both metadata and profiles table for redundancy\n- Profiles table allows for future expansion (avatar, bio, etc.)\n- Guest users have full app functionality except data persistence\n- Deep linking requires app rebuild to test properly\n",
