lopment build, not Expo Go\n\n**Issue**: Guest banner not appearing\n**Fix**: Make sure you're signed in as guest (check Settings for \"Guest Account\" badge)\n\n**Issue**: \"Profile already exists\" error\n**Fix**: Delete existing profile in Supabase, then sign up again\n\n## Quick Commands\n\n```bash\n# Start development server\nnpm start\n\n# Build for iOS (requires Mac)\nnpx expo run:ios\n\n# Build for Android\nnpx expo run:android\n\n# Clear cache if issues\nnpx expo start -c\n```\n\n## Verification Checklist\n\nBefore considering complete:\n\n- [ ] Can create account with username\n- [ ] Username appears in Settings\n- [ ] Can request password reset\n- [ ] Can sign in as guest\n- [ ] Guest banner appears\n- [ ] Guest warning on sign out\n- [ ] Profile created in Supabase for all user types\n\n## Next Steps\n\nOnce basic testing is complete:\n\n1. **Test on physical device** for deep linking\n2. **Add more profile fields** (avatar, bio)\n3. **Implement guest conversion** (guest → permanent account)\n4. **Add username validation** (check availability during signup)\n5. **Add profile editing** (change username, avatar)\n\n## Support\n\nIf you encounter issues:\n1. Check Supabase logs (Dashboard → Logs)\n2. Check app console for errors\n3. Verify database trigger is working\n4. Test with fresh user account\n",
