tAccountScreen` import\n- Added screen to Stack Navigator with modal presentation\n- Screen accessible from anywhere in app\n\n#### SettingsScreen.tsx\n**Changes:**\n- \"Sign Out\" dialog now offers \"Convert Account\" option\n- Added double confirmation for \"Sign Out Anyway\"\n- Navigation to ConvertAccountScreen\n\n**Dialog Flow:**\n```\nGuest clicks \"Sign Out\"\n  ↓\nAlert: \"Convert your account to keep favorites, or sign out to lose them\"\n  ↓\nOptions:\n  1. \"Convert Account\" → Navigate to ConvertAccountScreen\n  2. \"Sign Out Anyway\" → Second confirmation dialog\n  3. \"Cancel\" → Close dialog\n```\n\n**Second Confirmation:**\n```\nUser clicks \"Sign Out Anyway\"\n  ↓\nAlert: \"Are you sure? All favorites will be permanently lost.\"\n  ↓\nOptions:\n  1. \"Cancel\" → Go back\n  2. \"Yes, Sign Out\" → Actually sign out\n```\n\n#### HomeScreen.tsx\n- Guest banner now navigates to ConvertAccountScreen\n- Button text changed to \"Convert Now\"\n\n#### GuestBanner.tsx\n- Prop renamed: `onSignUp` → `onConvert`\n- Text updated: \"Convert to permanent account\"\n- Button text: \"Convert Now\"\n\n## User Experience\n\n### Conversion Flow\n1. **Guest sees banner** on Home screen\n2. **Clicks \"Convert Now\"** or goes to Settings → Sign Out → Convert Account\n3. **Modal appears** with conversion form\n4. **Enters details:**\n   - Username (e.g., \"john_doe\")\n   - Email (e.g., \"john@example.com\")\n   - Password (min 6 chars)\n   - Confirm password\n5. **Clicks \"Convert Account\"**\n6. **System processes:**\n   - Validates inputs\n   - Links email/password to account\n   - Updates profile\n   - Sends verification email\n7. **Success message shown**\n8. **User remains logged in** with all favorites intact\n9. **Can now sign in from any device** using email/password\n\n### Sign Out Flow (Optional)\n1. **Guest clicks \"Sign Out\"** in Settings\n2. **First dialog:** Convert or Sign Out?\n3. **If \"Sign Out Anyway\"** → Second confirmation\n4. **Second dialog:** \"Are you sure? Data will be lost.\"\n5. **If \"Yes, Sign Out\"** → Actually signs out\n\n## Data Preservation\n\n### What Gets Preserved\n✅ **User ID** - Same UUID maintained\n✅ **Favorites** - All stream favorites kept\n✅ **Profile** - Username updated, is_guest set to false\n✅ **Session** - User stays logged in\n✅ **Created date** - Original account creation date\n\n### What Changes\n- `auth.users.email` - Set to provided email\n- `auth.users.encrypted_password` - Set to provided password\n- `auth.users.raw_user_meta_data.username` - Updated\n- `profiles.username` - Changed from `guest_12345678` to chosen username\n- `profiles.is_guest` - Changed from `true` to `false`\n- `profiles.updated_at` - Updated to current timestamp\n\n### What's Sent\n- **Verification email** to provided email address\n- User must verify email to enable password recovery\n\n## Validation Rules\n\n### Username\n- Minimum 3 characters\n- Must be unique (checked by database function)\n- Trimmed of whitespace\n- Case-sensitive\n\n### Email\n- Valid email format (handled by Supabase)\n- Must be unique (handled by Supabase)\n- Trimmed of whitespace\n- Verification email sent\n\n### Password\n- Minimum 6 characters\n- Must match confirmation\n- Encrypted by Supabase\n\n## Error Handling\n\n### Possible Errors\n1. **Username taken** - \"Username already taken\"\n2. **Email taken** - \"Email already registered\"\n3. **Network error** - \"Failed to convert account. Please try again.\"\n4. **Validation error** - Specific field error shown\n\n### User Feedback\n- Loading spinner during conversion\n- Success alert with instructions\n- Error alerts with clear messages\n- Form validation before submission\n\n## Testing Checklist\n\n### Conversion Success\n- [ ] Guest can access ConvertAccountScreen\n- [ ] Form validates all inputs\n- [ ] Conversion preserves all favorites\n- [ ] User stays logged in after conversion\n- [ ] Username updates in Settings\n- [ ] Guest badge removed after conversion\n- [ ] Verification email received\n\n### Conversion Errors\n- [ ] Username too short shows error\n- [ ] Passwords not matching shows error\n- [ ] Duplicate username shows error\n- [ ] Duplicate email shows error\n- [ ] Network error handled gracefully\n\n### Sign Out Flow\n- [ ] First dialog shows conversion option\n- [ ] Second confirmation required for sign out\n- [ ] Cancel works at both steps\n- [ ] Actual sign out works after double confirmation\n\n### Banner\n- [ ] Shows for guest users\n- [ ] \"Convert Now\" navigates to conversion screen\n- [ ] Dismissal persists across sessions\n\n## Database Function\n\n### convert_guest_to_permanent\n**Already created in Supabase setup**\n\n**Parameters:**\n- `new_username` (TEXT) - Desired username\n\n**Returns:**\n- JSON object with `success` (boolean) and `error` (string)\n\n**Logic:**\n1. Checks if user is authenticated\n2. Verifies user is actually a guest\n3. Checks username availability\n4. Updates profile with new username\n5. Sets `is_guest` to false\n6. Returns success/error status\n\n## Benefits\n\n### For Users\n✅ No data loss\n✅ Seamless experience\n✅ Stay logged in\n✅ Clear call-to-action\n✅ Optional (not forced)\n\n### For App\n✅ Better retention\n✅ More permanent accounts\n✅ Cleaner data model\n✅ Better UX\n✅ Reduced support issues\n\n## Future Enhancements\n\n### Mandatory Conversion\n- Force conversion after X favorites\n- Block certain features for guests\n- Time-limited guest access\n\n### Enhanced Validation\n- Real-time username availability check\n- Password strength indicator\n- Email format validation\n\n### Social Conversion\n- Convert via Google/Apple sign-in\n- Link multiple auth methods\n- Import data from other platforms\n\n## Notes\n\n- Conversion is **optional** - guests can continue as guests\n- Sign out requires **double confirmation** to prevent accidental data loss\n- Verification email sent but **not required** for immediate use\n- Same `user_id` ensures **all data preserved**\n- Works with existing database schema and functions\n",
