ne permanently\n**Solution:**\n- Auto-check stream status weekly\n- Remove streams offline for 30+ days\n- Show \"Last verified\" timestamp\n\n### **4. Privacy**\n**Problem:** Users don't want to share publicly\n**Solution:**\n- Make sharing optional\n- Anonymous sharing option\n- Private favorites vs public shares\n\n---\n\n## **Implementation Phases:**\n\n### **Phase 1: MVP (Week 1)**\n- ✅ Community streams table\n- ✅ Browse community streams\n- ✅ Add to My List (one-tap)\n- ✅ Basic UI\n\n### **Phase 2: Engagement (Week 2)**\n- ✅ Like/unlike functionality\n- ✅ Sort by popularity\n- ✅ Share from My List\n- ✅ Search/filter\n\n### **Phase 3: Polish (Week 3)**\n- ✅ Platform filters\n- ✅ Category tags\n- ✅ User profiles (top contributors)\n- ✅ Trending section\n\n### **Phase 4: Advanced (Future)**\n- ✅ Comments/reviews\n- ✅ Follow users\n- ✅ Personalized recommendations\n- ✅ Moderation tools\n\n---\n\n## **Technical Considerations:**\n\n### **Performance:**\n- Pagination (20 streams per page)\n- Caching popular streams\n- Lazy loading thumbnails\n\n### **Security:**\n- RLS policies (users can only like once)\n- Rate limiting on shares\n- URL validation\n\n### **Data Integrity:**\n- Unique constraint on URLs\n- Cascade deletes for likes\n- Automatic cleanup of orphaned data\n\n---\n\n## **Metrics to Track:**\n\n1. **Engagement:**\n   - Community streams viewed\n   - Streams added from community\n   - Like/unlike actions\n\n2. **Growth:**\n   - New streams shared per day\n   - Active contributors\n   - Retention rate\n\n3. **Quality:**\n   - Average likes per stream\n   - Dead stream rate\n   - User reports\n\n---\n\n## **My Recommendation:**\n\n### **✅ YES, Build This Feature!**\n\n**Why:**\n1. **High Value** - Solves real user pain (discovery)\n2. **Network Effects** - Gets better with more users\n3. **Differentiation** - Unique feature vs competitors\n4. **Engagement** - Keeps users coming back\n5. **Growth** - Viral potential\n\n### **Start with MVP:**\n- Community t